 be due to the fact that ducky was an  oyran as an oiran daki was likely an  important source of income for muzon  even though muzan himself is a lot more  powerful than a human he still lives in  a world that has a lot more humans than  it has demons and in order to remain  hidden from the demon slayers muzan has  to navigate his way through this human  world this means that he needs money and  connections and ducky's status as an  odan definitely provided him with those  important things we know that upper moon  gyoko is well alike by muzan because his  pods fetch a high price so it is clear  that muzan knows the value of money this  could be why he also valued doki or at  least why he wanted her to think that he  values her and that is it the full story  of dakian gyutaro's tragic and dark life  what did you guys think of them as  characters and do you like them as  villains where would you rank them in  terms of your favorite villains in the  demon slayer story i probably like akaza  and doma more and i don't mean i like  doma as a person he's the sickest most  evil maniac out there but that makes him  a good villain and also kokushibo is  just so badass but after those guys doki  and kyutaro are probably my favorites  muzan himself is one of my least  favorite to be honest since his  character doesn't really have nearly as  much depth compared to most of the other  villains  if you guys enjoyed this video and you  want to see more demonstrate content on  the channel just leave a quick like it  only takes a second but it helps a lot  and of course if you're new to the  channel or maybe you watch our videos  but you just haven't taken the time to  subscribe yet if you could make this the  video that you subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications it will really help me out  a lot and of course it's completely free  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at animeopror thanks again to  nordvpn for sponsoring this video check  them out link in the description as  always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys
 

